  "evidenceNotes": [
    "Pinned BWAPI4.4.0/OpenBW facts reproduce exactly: Nest100/100 research500ticks,Queen150energy/288px,ground organic-or-mechanical nonrobotic nonbuilding targets. Friendly SCVs/tanks/Dragoons and visible burrowed bodies are supported; robotic Probe/Reaver,air,cargo,hidden and Stasis victims are excluded.",
    "Authored immediate/no-approach18tick cooldown shares both ways with Parasite/Ensnare. Normal cleanup removes the victim first; up to2 broodlings reserve legal positions using deterministic offset/ring placement. Blocked positions or entity cap reduce spawns without refunding kill or payment. No production/resources/supply charge for summons.",
    "Broodlings:30HP,0supply,Toxic Spores normal4+melee-upgrade ground damage,15frame cooldown,2px melee reach. Lifetime1800originalframes=1500ticks=75seconds remains absolute in cargo/Stasis and after source death. Expiry removes cargo/groups/status references. Own lifetime/status and cargo rows,distinct vector marker and visible cast effect are rendered; enemy timers and internal spell references remain private.",
